WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Sure enough

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:11,680
Dad prepared so many lunch boxes for the fish

3
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,080
Only two portions of fish

4
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:17,430
Where did the rest go?

5
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:19,630
I guess it's because your Aunt Huang thinks it's bad if she drinks too much.

6
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:23,220
Throw it away for you, right?

7
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,020
The temperature difference between China and America is different

8
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,740
If wine is added to the rice, it will go bad.

9
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:32,660
Eating it will cause diarrhea

10
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,460
I want to eat your father’s food so much

11
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:39,370
Just ask your Aunt Huang to send you back, okay?

12
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,990
Anyway, fried fish is so spicy
